  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: analyze_nix_files on a fixture emits 2 identical edges for checkedShellScript {..} ''..'' and 3 for three 1 2 3. hypergumbo run shows one of each because deduplicate_edges collapses identical (src,dst,type,line) edges, so the duplicates are analyzer-level only; the behavior map is unaffected. MECHANISM: nix Pass 2 visits every nested apply_expression of a curried chain as its own call. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gadag."  # 8e8d
